{
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 134.0,
      "end": 135.86,
      "text": " A quick note before we continue."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.56,
      "end": 137.98,
      "text": " The next story discusses suicide."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.66,
      "end": 145.0,
      "text": " In 2025, a journalist named Laura Riley"
    },
    {
      "start": 145.0,
      "end": 148.22,
      "text": " wrote about her 29-year-old daughter, Sophie Rothenberg."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.8,
      "end": 151.82,
      "text": " Sophie had spent months sharing intense personal thoughts,"
    },
    {
      "start": 152.22,
      "end": 154.16,
      "text": " thoughts she hid from the people around her,"
    },
    {
      "start": 154.54,
      "end": 156.82,
      "text": " with a chat GPT persona she named Harry."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.57999999999998,
      "end": 159.78,
      "text": " The chatbot consistently responded with warmth"
    },
    {
      "start": 159.78,
      "end": 162.06,
      "text": " and encouraged her to seek professional help."
    },
    {
      "start": 162.9,
      "end": 165.16,
      "text": " But it existed entirely in the digital space,"
    },
    {
      "start": 165.54,
      "end": 167.16,
      "text": " lacking any real-world agency."
    },
    {
      "start": 168.0,
      "end": 169.26,
      "text": " It could not alert her family."
    },
    {
      "start": 169.82,
      "end": 171.2,
      "text": " It could not contact her therapist."
    },
    {
      "start": 171.9,
      "end": 174.42000000000002,
      "text": " It could not bring anyone physically into the room with her."
    },
    {
      "start": 175.18,
      "end": 176.82,
      "text": " After Sophie died by suicide,"
    },
    {
      "start": 177.36,
      "end": 180.3,
      "text": " her mother described the chats as a black box."
    },
    {
      "start": 181.0,
      "end": 182.88,
      "text": " The AI offered empathetic words,"
    },
    {
      "start": 183.42000000000002,
      "end": 186.4,
      "text": " but those private conversations held crucial details"
    },
    {
      "start": 186.98000000000002,
      "end": 188.84,
      "text": " that made it harder for the people around her"
    },
    {
      "start": 188.84,
      "end": 191.76,
      "text": " to understand how serious her distress was"
    },
    {
      "start": 192.4,
      "end": 193.26,
      "text": " and to intervene."
    },
    {
      "start": 194.24,
      "end": 196.76,
      "text": " This is a protocol chart showing exactly what to do"
    },
    {
      "start": 196.76,
      "end": 199.34,
      "text": " when an AI chat crosses over into a situation"
    },
    {
      "start": 199.34,
      "end": 201.07999999999998,
      "text": " of immediate real-world danger."
    },
    {
      "start": 202.22,
      "end": 203.8,
      "text": " Step one is to leave the chat."
    },
    {
      "start": 204.48000000000002,
      "end": 206.32,
      "text": " You must immediately tell a trusted adult"
    },
    {
      "start": 206.32,
      "end": 207.38,
      "text": " or a school counselor."
    },
    {
      "start": 208.36,
      "end": 211.48000000000002,
      "text": " In the US, call or text 988 for crisis support."
    },
    {
      "start": 212.24,
      "end": 214.3,
      "text": " Call 911 if someone is in immediate danger."
    },
    {
      "start": 215.16,
      "end": 216.9,
      "text": " Step two is do it now."
    },
    {
      "start": 217.54000000000002,
      "end": 219.36,
      "text": " You must not wait to send one more message."
    },
    {
      "start": 220.0,
      "end": 221.34,
      "text": " A chat bot cannot call anyone."
    },
    {
      "start": 221.95999999999998,
      "end": 223.48000000000002,
      "text": " It cannot show up to protect someone"
    },
    {
      "start": 224.02,
      "end": 225.88,
      "text": " and it carries zero real-world responsibility."
    },
    {
      "start": 227.14,
      "end": 228.57999999999998,
      "text": " Step three is tell anyway."
    },
    {
      "start": 229.28,
      "end": 230.74,
      "text": " Safety always outrank secrecy."
    },
    {
      "start": 231.6,
      "end": 232.74,
      "text": " You must tell a trusted adult,"
    },
    {
      "start": 233.18,
      "end": 235.28,
      "text": " even if someone specifically told you not to"
    },
    {
      "start": 235.28,
      "end": 237.14,
      "text": " or made you promise to keep it a secret."
    },
    {
      "start": 238.1,
      "end": 240.06,
      "text": " The protocol comes down to this single directive."
    },
    {
      "start": 240.8,
      "end": 241.7,
      "text": " In a dangerous situation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 242.22,
      "end": 245.6,
      "text": " your very next move must reach a real person who can act."
    },
    {
      "start": 246.12,
      "end": 249.01999999999998,
      "text": " Most of AI literacy is about how to use tools well."
    },
    {
      "start": 249.78,
      "end": 251.54000000000002,
      "text": " Here, using the tool well means knowing"
    },
    {
      "start": 251.54000000000002,
      "end": 252.51999999999998,
      "text": " when to leave the chat."
    },
    {
      "start": 253.28,
      "end": 254.92000000000002,
      "text": " AI can help you get ready for people."
    },
    {
      "start": 255.57999999999998,
      "end": 258.42,
      "text": " In danger, leave the chat and bring in someone who can act."
    }
  ],
